  {
   "text": "Ukraine's CERT-UA and Cato CTRL reported LAMEHUG, the first known malware to integrate a large language model (Qwen2.5-Coder-32B-Instruct via Hugging Face) for real-time command generation.",
   "slug_or_none": "none-established",
   "report_ids": [
    6241,
    6242
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Attributed with moderate confidence to APT28 (Fancy Bear), the malware reportedly targeted Ukrainian officials through phishing emails.",
